icularly doomy, you can go here, you can escalate, you can vote to escalate or deescalate the doom meter. I'm going to go ahead and raise it. It's got a really nice little sound to it. Let's see if we can get it up to Doom Factor 6. All right, guys. Also a huge shout out to all of our members and all of our people on Patreon, everyone who supports not only this show, Night Shift, but Seeker Activo, That UFO Podcast, Dreamland Motel, others from Another Mother, and all of the other podcasts that we invite on this show and that we know and all of our creator friends in this space. If you're supporting any of these people, God bless you. Thank you for doing that. It makes it possible for us to do this and we just can't thank you enough. So whatever you do to support your favorite creator, please continue to do so. It really means a lot. And with that out of the way.

