his up. This is my intellectual property. But he still has people funding that fantasy. So it's a topic that I think more and more people find their tribe with it. I know that's a big thing in psychology, finding your tribe. And I think that happens with a lot of different things. Football, I know myself and Pavel are huge football fans. You know, musicians like Dan, you know, people find their tribe and you stick to it. But people can be so stubborn and pigheaded and not be able to see the kind of wood from the trees at times. So yeah, I think that answers your question.

